  "source": "EIA glossary, 'Net summer capacity', retrieved 2026-09-03",
  "quote": "The maximum output, commonly expressed in megawatts (MW), that generating equipment can supply to system load, as demonstrated by a multi-hour test, at the time of summer peak demand (period of June 1 through September 30.)",
