  "unreachable_on_keeper": "arrays.py guards the block with 'and not _td_on'; the keeper sets temp_dependent_derate=True (scope CT_CHP/ST_CHP only), so the guard is GLOBAL while the scope is PER-CLASS and arming gt_ambient_derate for MISO's merchant classes would change nothing today."
